OL,3,ANvidia hires major New York law firm to
OL,4,Ainvestigate Jensen Huang affair
OL,5,
OL,6,FNvidia has hired New York law firm
OL,7,FWachtell, Lipton, Rosen & Katz to
OL,8,Finvestigate the affair between its
OL,9,Fchief executive and an alleged Chinese
OL,10,Fspy.
OL,12,FJensen Huang, a co-founder of Nvidia
OL,13,Fwho has led it to become one of the
OL,14,Fmost valuable companies in the world,
OL,15,Fadmitted to having a romantic
OL,16,Frelationship with a woman outside of
OL,17,Fhis marriage.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
