PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1794345511
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ADavid Walliams accused of sexual
OL,4,Amisconduct after losing injunction bid
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome of the women accuse Walliams of
OL,7,F"grooming" them when they were
OL,8,Fteenagers. One now characterises her
OL,9,Falleged encounter with Walliams at
OL,10,F15-years- old as a "sexual assault".
OL,12,FIn a letter to journalists published by
OL,13,Fthe Guardian, Walliams said he was "not
OL,14,Fa sexual predator" and had not "broken
OL,15,Fthe law".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
