OL,3,ADavid Walliams' career and
OL,4,Acontroversies including Britain's Got
OL,5,ATalent and Little Britain
OL,6,
OL,7,FDavid Walliams has been accused of
OL,8,Fgrooming young fans and harassing women
OL,9,Fin the workplace, after failing to stop
OL,10,Fthe Guardian and ITN publishing claims
OL,11,Fagainst him.
OL,13,FA three-year investigation by the two
OL,14,Fnews organisations alleged the Little
OL,15,FBritain star and former Britain's Got
OL,16,FTalent judge preyed on teenage girls as
OL,17,Fyoung as 15 and young women for sexual
OL,18,Fpurposes.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11913
SC,0013
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1794345511
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ADavid Walliams' career and
OL,4,Acontroversies including Britain's Got
OL,5,ATalent and Little Britain
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe had sought a High Court injunction
OL,8,Fto prevent publication, with his
OL,9,Flawyers arguing if allegations were
OL,10,Fmade public Walliams would likely kill
OL,11,Fhimself. The court refused the request.
OL,13,FWalliams has denied all of the
OL,14,Fallegations but in a letter to
OL,15,Fjournalists working on the
OL,16,Finvestigation acknowledged "at times I
OL,17,Fbehaved thoughtlessly towards other
OL,18,Fpeople I had casual sexual
OL,19,Frelationships with".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
